From de1c12e317627a919b04436df8e4f0abc1ab0be4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 07:45:32 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] Move undo record creation and freeing into undorecord.c

Four hand-built records in mutate.c become undoRecordNew.  The record-construction
invariant in run_tests.sh now names both constructors, and allows undorecord.c.
No behaviour change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01947MBgCkoERXfoyRGfCmQi
